  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You receive a string `word`. A letter `c` is called **special** if it appears **both** in lowercase and uppercase in `word`, and **every** lowercase occurrence of `c` appears before the **first** uppercase occurrence of `c`.\n\nOutput the number of**special** lettersin`word`.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n**Input:** word = \"aaAbcBC\"\n\n**Output:** 3\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe special characters are `'a'`, `'b'`, and `'c'`.\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n**Input:** word = \"abc\"\n\n**Output:** 0\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThere are no special characters in `word`.\n\n**Example 3:**\n\n**Input:** word = \"AbBCab\"\n\n**Output:** 0\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThere are no special characters in `word`.\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= word.length <= 2 * 105`\n* `word` is composed of only lowercase and uppercase English letters.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
